   "record": "52862befa0318f9d6ae27013025b85849e993b92761e7715a08bf823d924ca3f",
   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: representation (a screen wider than the source); i4562 p. 15 and p946 p. 60 define the electric-vehicle category as vehicles produced by an original equipment manufacturer, designed to run primarily on electricity and placed in service after August 5, 1997, and before 2007. The screen item \"it is an electric vehicle placed in service before 2007\" refuses every such vehicle and more; any vehicle placed in service before 2007 is also refused by the first item (\"you placed it in service before 2019\"). A wider refusal changes no computed amount. The item's wording is unchanged by the R3 restructuring. Project stands.",
   "subject_key": "71b6abe6ca3b2ce08667bcd5ac96ff71a20454904885e1886cf61b2d4a2128ef"
  },
