   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: model error; p946 pp. 61-62, Depreciation Worksheet for Passenger Automobiles, line 13, \"Multiply line 12 by line 8. This is your business/investment cost\". The handle 13 is that worksheet line, not Schedule C line 13; depreciation and the automobile limits are on later worksheet lines (scveh.macrs). Same point as the Claude ruling of this line. Project stands.",
